	elasticity:
		- stiffness order adds odd exponent to (x-q) (^1, ^3...) and functions are k, K1, K3...
		- damping order adds all exponents from 1 to ord+1 (considering the direction, friction wants to stop the movement), fun are d, D1, D2...
		☐ obtain orders directly from size of elastic parameters arrays
		☐ each joint with different orders?
		☐ could be usefull to use also even orders?
		☐ add inertia coupling S and for complete elastic model
		☐ if order==1 K0, D0, Dl0, Dm0 => K, D, Dl, Dm.. It is more intuitive
		☐ derivative of k, d, dl, dm
		☐ check everything, k, d, dl, dm are vectors, K, D, Dl, Dm are matrices
		☐ selection matrix for elastic joints
		☐ elastic matrices and quantities are related on motor side equation, have to be modified to use in link side equation by selection matrix
